# 🛒 SimplCommerce E2E Automation Assignment

[![Playwright Tests](https://github.com/Spidey44/MN-Coding-Exercise---Automate-demo.simplcommerce-with-Playwright/actions/workflows/playwright.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/Spidey44/MN-Coding-Exercise---Automate-demo.simplcommerce-with-Playwright/actions)
[![Playwright Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/Playwright-1.40+-2EAD33.svg)](https://playwright.dev/)

This project is a comprehensive end-to-end testing assignment designed to validate critical user journeys on the **SimplCommerce** demo e-commerce platform.

---

## 📋 Deliverables Overview

As per the assignment requirements, this repository includes:

### 1️⃣ Test Design Document
*   **Identification**: Key test cases for cart management and checkout flows.
*   **Prioritization**: Scenarios prioritized based on **Risk, Frequency, and Business Value**.
*   **File**: [Download Test Plan (Simplcommerce.xlsx)](./Coding%20Testwares/Simplcommerce.xlsx)

### 2️⃣ Automation Code (Playwright + JavaScript)
Implemented robust automation for the following critical journeys:
*   **Cart**: Adding/Removing products.
*   **Data-Driven**: Updating product quantities across multiple products.
*   **Checkout**: Successful flow with valid details.
*   **Negative Testing**: Attempting checkout with missing/invalid details (address/payment).

### 3️⃣ Test Execution Output
*   Sample test run results with logs and screenshots.
*   HTML reports generated after each execution.

### 4️⃣ CI/CD Integration (Bonus)
*   Full integration with **GitHub Actions** for automated regression testing.
